# Mechanical clocks do not support time increments; digital (preference)

Standing user preference: Mechanical clocks do not support time increments; digital clocks with increment are recommended and have made increment-based time controls the modern standard.

## Conventions
- Mechanical clocks do not support time increments; digital clocks with increment are recommended and have made increment-based time controls the modern standard.

